  ,"menu_title": "🖱️ Windows Context Menu"
  ,"menu_description": "Register the Windows context menu to quickly access Copy and Move.\n\n✅ Right-click file/folder → Advanced Copy\n✅ Right-click file/folder → Advanced Move\n\nThe source will be the selected file/folder and the GUI will open a browse dialog to choose the destination."
  ,"menu_hw_title": "🔧 Hardware Optimization"
  ,"menu_hw_text": "The system automatically detects the storage type:\n\n🚀 NVMe: Buffer 256MB, 12 threads\n⚡ SSD: Buffer 128MB, 8 threads\n💾 HDD: Buffer 80MB, 2 threads\n🔌 USB: Buffer 64MB, 4 threads\n🌐 NAS: Buffer 32MB, 2 threads\n💾 RamDrive: Buffer 8MB (pure RAM), 16 threads\n\nParameters are automatically adjusted based on the destination path."
